# Frontend (Vite) — copy to `.env.development` / `.env.local` (not committed)
#
# Local dev (recommended): leave BOTH unset → requests use `/api/...` and Vite proxies to FastAPI :8765 (`npm run dev:all`).
# Direct API (SSE, debugging): uncomment ONE (no trailing slash).
# VITE_API_ORIGIN=http://127.0.0.1:8765
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8765
#
# Production / preview on Vercel: set VITE_API_ORIGIN to your Railway (or other) API URL in Vercel env vars.
# Backend must list your frontend origin in ALLOWED_ORIGINS (comma-separated), or set CORS_PREVIEW_REGEX for *.vercel.app.
